 class="font-display text-[28px] uppercase leading-none text-ink">2 taps</p><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/55">Start, lap or end a session</p></li><li><p class="font-display text-[28px] uppercase leading-none text-ink">4</p><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink/55">Distinct haptic patterns</p></li></ul></div><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-14 rounded-[32px] bg-surface p-3 sm:p-4"><div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-[28px] bg-white px-6 pb-10 pt-8 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-5"><div class="relative flex size-48 items-center justify-center sm:size-56"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-ink/10 transition-transform duration-200"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-8 rounded-full border border-ink/15 transition-transform duration-200"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-16 w-28 rounded-[22px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#3a3a3f] to-[#1d1d20] shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] transition-transform duration-100"></span><p class="absolute -bottom-2 text-center text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink/55">Tap a cue to feel it</p></div></div><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7"><li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="flex h-full w-full flex-col rounded-[24px] border p-5 text-left sm:p-6 transition-colors duration-300 border-transparent bg-white hover:border-ink/25"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Zone up</span><span class="inline-flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-4 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span></span>